      "content": "Close Reason fact identities are never included in the section-wide `factIds` set; that check still visits only `document.facts`. Consequently, a single otherwise valid Close Reason can reuse a Position Change/Execution identity, or another Trade's Close Reason identity, without producing `DuplicateFactIdentity`. Include `closeReasonFacts` in the shared identity-validation pass (independently of whether derivation succeeds), and add coverage for both collision cases.",
