      "content": "Keep the known product keys scoped to their Catalog kind. Combining both families allows a Strategy with `productKey: 'close-reason.target-reached'` (or a Close Reason with `strategy.long-stock`) to pass validation, even though its own seed manifest does not define that key. This also weakens the existing Strategy validation. Use separate key sets and select the appropriate set based on `record.kind`.",
